  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIRST (phase III) - Financial Sector Reform and Strengthening Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To help strengthen financial sectors in low income countries by making them more stable, efficient and inclusive, so that they better support economic growth and poverty reduction.  Expected outcomes include improved regulation and supervision, an increase in bank accounts held by adults, greater access to financial services by Small and Medium Enterprises and increased provision of long term financing through bonds and equity.</narrative>
  </description>
